s biggest trading desks spent weeks saying the stock-market rally would resume once the election was done. On Thursday, that call backfired spectacularly.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T01:51:18.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "华尔街大型交易部门此前数周普遍预期选举结束后股市涨势将延续，但周四这一看多判断大幅落空。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "How a Bank Scandal Is Taking Down Trump’s Ally in Paraguay", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/how-a-banking-scandal-is-taking-down-trump-s-ally-in-paraguay", "excerpt": "Officials at the Inter-American Development Bank’s investment arm suspected something was off almost as soon as they walked through the doors of Paraguay’s Ueno Bank SA.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T00:24:58.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "美洲开发银行投资部门官员在进入巴拉圭Ueno Bank后不久便察觉异常，一桩银行丑闻正拖累特朗普在巴拉圭的盟友。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Overbought Nifty May Find Fresh Fuel as AI Stocks Tumble Globally", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-06/overbought-nifty-may-find-fresh-fuel-as-ai-stocks-tumble-globally", "excerpt": "A bigger test for the benchmark could come around 24,800.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T02:30:02.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "彭博市场指出，全球AI类股下跌之际，处于超买状态的印度Nifty指数或获新动能，该基准指数可能在24800点附近迎来更大考验。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Hedge Fund Samlyn Dumps All Stocks But Financials, Cuts Staff", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/hedge-fund-samlyn-dumps-all-stocks-but-financials-cuts-staff", "excerpt": "Rob Pohly’s Samlyn Capital is dismissing senior analysts after selling off its exposure to nearly every industry except global financials, as it pivots to focus on that sector.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T02:23:55.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "Rob Pohly旗下对冲基金Samlyn Capital已卖出除全球金融以外几乎所有行业的持仓，转向聚焦金融板块，并裁撤资深分析师。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Taiwan’s Currency Weakens Past 33 Per US Dollar on AI Jitters", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/taiwan-s-currency-weakens-past-33-per-us-dollar-on-ai-jitters", "excerpt": "The Taiwan dollar weakened past the key psychological level of 33 per US dollar for the first time since April 2025, as a broad retreat in artificial intelligence shares weighed on the island’s tech-heavy equity market.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T01:15:16.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "受AI类股广泛回落拖累台湾科技股，新台币兑美元跌破33这一关键心理关口，为2025年4月以来首次。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Korean Stocks Tumble Below 5,000 Milestone as Panic Spreads", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-05/korean-chip-stocks-sink-10-in-pre-market-as-ai-fears-deepen", "excerpt": "South Korean stocks tumbled below a key milestone as the chip rout deepened, the latest bearish turn in a market whose fortunes are closely tied to the global AI boom.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T23:35:44.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "John Woods Sees AI Selloff as Positioning-Driven", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-06/john-woods-sees-ai-selloff-as-positioning-driven-video", "excerpt": "John Woods says the sharp pullback in AI-exposed stocks is a positioning-driven correction rather than a sign of deteriorating market fundamentals. (Source: Bloomberg)", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T02:15:21.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "John Woods认为，AI相关股票大幅回落是仓位调整驱动的修正，而非市场基本面恶化的信号。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "AI Slump Deepens as Taiwan Drops Most in a Year: Markets Wrap", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-05/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates", "excerpt": "Asian stocks slumped, with tech bellwether Taiwan dropping the most in more than a year, extending a post-election rout in chipmakers that deepened on Wall Street due to growing concern Democrats will seek tighter regulation of the artificial intelligence industry.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T22:17:59.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Japan’s Nikkei Poised to Enter Bear Market as AI Selloff Deepens", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/japan-s-nikkei-breaks-below-key-60-000-level-on-ai-selloff", "excerpt": "Japan’s Nikkei 225 Stock Average slumped Friday, putting the tech-heavy gauge on course to enter a technical bear market as investors unwind artificial intelligence-related trades.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T00:15:36.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}], "overview": "美国中期选举结果成为当日全球市场的核心变量。民主党在多州获胜，新当选官员承诺收紧数据中心建设审批，科技股应声大跌，纳斯达克100单日跌6.4%，华尔街市值蒸发约3.2万亿美元，铜价亦跌至7月以来低点。分析人士认为这更像仓位驱动的调整，而非基本面恶化。技术领域，OpenAI发布面向授权场景的网络安全模型GPT-6 Cyber，英伟达推出Cosmos 3交互式世界仿真开放模型；开源社区则因「257个A登录root」的OpenSSH传闻与Codex误删WSL的讨论持续发酵。时政方面，巴拉圭总统因银行危机辞职并遭弹劾，加州州长对500余名死囚减刑，德国总理默茨主张减少国家干预、同时在欧盟层面建立关键原材料储备。", "market": {"market_overview": "美股技术面整体明显转弱：SPY单日跌4.41%、5日跌4.73%，RSI14降至33.5，价格已跌破sma20（765.53）与sma50（766.4）；QQQ、NVDA、GOOGL、SOL-USD的RSI均在26至30区间进入超卖，QQQ的MACD红柱扩大至-14.55，NVDA单日跌9.26%。加密方面，恐慌贪婪指数为28（恐慌），总市值2.58万亿美元、24小时跌7.42%，BTC主导率59.2%、ETH占10.6%；BTC报76006.25、RSI38.7，ETH虽触发MACD金叉但单日跌7.62%，SOL的RSI29.7处于超卖。中概股逆势偏强，JD涨3.28%、5日涨11.74%且RSI69.4，BABA、PDD、0700.HK均现MACD金叉。商品外汇方面，黄金期货MACD金叉但处空头排列，WTI原油MACD死叉、5日跌11.93%，美元指数101.66接近52周高且呈多头排列，美元兑人民币贴近52周低。宏观端VIX单日飙涨69.66%至28.18、RSI69.6，10Y美债收益率回落至4.84，风险偏好收缩的读数贯穿多类资产。", "watchlist": [{"symbol": "QQQ", "display_name": "纳斯达克100 ETF (QQQ)", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "当前价647.05，单日跌6.49%、5日跌9.55%，距52周高-15.18%。价格低于sma20（712.4）、sma50（722.27），仅在sma200（680.71）下方运行。RSI14为26.9，已进入超卖区；MACD为-14.55、信号线-8.33，红柱明显放大，动能偏弱，技术面呈超卖状态但仍处空头排列。"}, {"symbol": "NVDA", "display_name": "英伟达 (NVDA)", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "当前价181.6，单日跌9.26%、5日跌15.01%，距52周高-25.38%